  "question_stem": "The equation $\\cot \\frac{1}{2}x = 3x$ has one root in the interval $0 < x < \\pi$, denoted by $\\alpha$.",
  "context_texts": [
    "At convergence $x = \\dfrac{1}{3}\\left[x + 4\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3x}\\right)\\right]$, which rearranges to $\\cot\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right) = 3x$."
  ],
